 "remarks": "Located within minutes of West Avenue's shops, restaurants and Noroton Heights' Metro-North train station, with easy access to I-95, its highly regarded schools, downtown and the shoreline of Darien. This home is one of 3 contiguous properties containing a 1924 vintage residence on .18 acres known at lot 44 and 2 additional land parcels (.761 acres known as 43A and .436 acres known as 41A respectively) This offering creates a rare starting point for those with vision, presenting an exciting possibility for builders, investors, or buyers looking to create a home tailored to their own needs. Opportunities like this do not come along often. Acreage shown is per survey and reflects the combined parcels. Taxes are an estimate of all three parcels. Survey and more information available upon request. Subject to probate.",
